| Tonka-sandal yielding interior | 780 | 13.000 | Restrained coumarinic warmth and fresh/dark/mineral sandalwood planes selected without depleted Polysantol |
| Pressure and edge relief | 200 | 3.333 | Compact compression, textile warmth, and micro-contrast without held liquid Ambrofix |
| Quiet finishing matrix | 660 | 11.000 | Green-floral adhesion, slow mass, and volatile-to-base transition |
