Restored Lemon FCF and Virginia cedar remove two former approximation penalties. No missing item blocks focused computational evaluation of V5, but Ginger CO2, Parmavert, and Violet Leaf Absolute block claims of literal ginger/violet realism. Polysantol is a physical-stock gap, while liquid Ambrofix and Bacdanol are execution-metadata gaps; none can be silently represented as an executable material.

## Controlled blinded topology test — future work

Keep the 5,890 uL protected nucleus constant; that nucleus includes V5's 110 uL baseline DPG carrier reserve. Omitted modules are replaced one-for-one with additional DPG, so all arms total 6,000 uL concentrate without strengthening the baseline.

- **FIBER+ (80 uL):** Jessemal increment 50 + Clary Sage EO 10% 10 + Beta Ionone 1% 20. Tests warm rhizome body and aromatic recurrence into violet/vetiver.
- **RELIEF+ (30 uL):** Ebanol 10% 10 + Javanol 10% 10 + Scentenal 0.1% 10. Tests front/rear micro-contrast and carved finishing.

| Arm | Protected core including 110 uL baseline DPG | FIBER+ | RELIEF+ | Additional DPG replacement | Total concentrate |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| A / 00 compressed control | 5890 | 0 | 0 | 110 | 6000 |
| B / 10 | 5890 | 80 | 0 | 30 | 6000 |
| C / 01 | 5890 | 0 | 30 | 80 | 6000 |
| D / 11 full V5 | 5890 | 80 | 30 | 0 | 6000 |

For a future authorized test, prepare each 6,000 uL concentrate master so every source aliquot meets the 10 uL floor; take 600 uL concentrate + 2,400 uL ethanol for each coded 3 mL bottle. Use two independently prepared master sets, anonymous randomized codes, balanced order, and a sealed key. Read at 0, 5, 30, and 120 minutes, then 6 and 24 hours. Record free description first; then score L'Homme identity, ginger surface, ginger interior, ginger-to-violet continuity, violet-leaf realism, violet-to-wood continuity, cedar/vetiver grain, airy/dense simultaneity, spatial depth, textural style, late ginger echo, overall liking, muddiness, metallic glare, blue drift, iris drift, sweetness, and fatigue.

Identity loss rejects an arm before abstract depth. A null or discordant result is `HOLD / NON-INFORMATIVE` at this dose and protocol.

